* fitc10 sweep corners for the Phase 3A robustness map (fitc10 campaign, 2026-10-22). New file; fitc10.lib unchanged.
* One-dimensional sweeps around fitc10 (MU 5.87, VTH0 0.65, SS 0.112, RCW 490, CI 0.70e-6, JOFF 1e-14, LOV 2).
* fc10_vthXXX: |V_th| = X.XX V at nominal mobility.  fc10_muXXX: mobility x0.XX at nominal V_th.
.lib fc10_vth045
.param MU=5.87 CI=0.70e-6 SS=0.112 RCW=490 JOFF=1e-14 VTH0=0.45 LOV=2
.endl fc10_vth045
